:: Check your phone {"position":"300,375","size":"100,100"}
Your phone lights up beside you. Messages from class group chats keep giving notifications about class changes, schedules, and people asking if anyone else is feeling nervous. Since you did not sleep much, you keep on thinking about the worst-case scenario at school. Walking into the wrong class, forgetting someone’s name, and saying the wrong thing on your first day. 

Your body feels heavy, and your thoughts are already racing. You know that whatever you do next will shape your day. 

''What are you going to do?''
<img src="pic 1.png" style= " max-width:350px; ">

[[→ Get up early and get ready for school]]
[[→ Snooze your alarm and sleep for a little longer]]



:: Find out your group {"position":"300,1250","size":"100,100"}
She pulled up the random team generator, and you start praying for a decent group. You got grouped with 2 guys and 2 girls. “Not bad,” you thought to yourself. 
<img src="pic 11.PNG" style= " max-width:350px; ">

[[You get into your group.]]


